<!-- ============ Features ============ -->
<section aria-labelledby="features-title" class="section section-dark" id="features">
<div class="container">
<div class="section-head reveal">
<span class="eyebrow">Packed with features</span>
<h2 id="features-title">Everything you need to run and grow your store</h2>
<p class="lead">We've only scratched the surface. Here's what comes built in with every 10xCart store.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature-grid" id="feature-grid">
<div class="feature reveal"><div class="feature-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="i"><use href="#i-receipt"></use></svg></div><div><h3>Unlimited orders</h3><p>Handle any number of orders seamlessly, without limits.</p></div></div>
<div class="feature reveal" style="--d:1"><div class="feature-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="i"><use href="#i-package"></use></svg></div><div><h3>Unlimited products</h3><p>List as many products as you want, with extensive inventory options.</p></div></div>
<div class="feature reveal" style="--d:2"><div class="feature-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="i"><use href="#i-tag"></use></svg></div><div><h3>Unlimited categories</h3><p>Organise products into limitless categories for easier browsing.</p></div></div>
<div class="feature reveal"><div class="feature-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="i"><use href="#i-users"></use></svg></div><div><h3>Unlimited customers</h3><p>Serve an endless number of customers as your business grows.</p></div></div>
<div class="feature reveal" style="--d:1"><div class="feature-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="i"><use href="#i-store"></use></svg></div><div><h3>Unlimited vendors</h3><p>Support unlimited sellers in your multi-vendor marketplace.</p></div></div>
<div class="feature reveal" style="--d:2"><div class="feature-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="i"><use href="#i-card"></use></svg></div><div><h3>Payment gateway integration</h3><p>Integrate multiple payment gateways for secure, convenient checkout.</p></div></div>
<div class="feature reveal"><div class="feature-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="i"><use href="#i-qr"></use></svg></div><div><h3>Instant payment QR codes</h3><p>A unique payment QR code is generated automatically for every order.</p></div></div>
<div class="feature reveal" style="--d:1"><div class="feature-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="i"><use href="#i-bell"></use></svg></div><div><h3>Push notifications</h3><p>Send real-time offers and updates straight to your customers' phones.</p></div></div>
<div class="feature reveal" style="--d:2"><div class="feature-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="i"><use href="#i-lock"></use></svg></div><div><h3>Secure OTP login</h3><p>Safe sign-up and login with OTP-based verification.</p></div></div>
<div class="feature reveal"><div class="feature-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="i"><use href="#i-trending"></use></svg></div><div><h3>Sales &amp; inventory dashboard</h3><p>Track sales, orders and stock levels at a glance.</p></div></div>
<div class="feature reveal" style="--d:1"><div class="feature-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="i"><use href="#i-percent"></use></svg></div><div><h3>Dynamic pricing</h3><p>Increase sales with dynamic product pricing and discounts.</p></div></div>
<div class="feature reveal" style="--d:2"><div class="feature-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="i"><use href="#i-server"></use></svg></div><div><h3>Your domain, your server</h3><p>Your store runs on hosting you own — we set it up and keep it maintained.</p></div></div>
<div class="feature is-extra"><div class="feature-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="i"><use href="#i-share"></use></svg></div><div><h3>Share products &amp; categories</h3><p>Share links that open your products and categories directly in your app.</p></div></div>
<div class="feature is-extra"><div class="feature-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="i"><use href="#i-infinity"></use></svg></div><div><h3>Unlimited transactions</h3><p>Process unlimited transactions for smooth, uninterrupted sales.</p></div></div>
<div class="feature is-extra"><div class="feature-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="i"><use href="#i-crown"></use></svg></div><div><h3>Memberships &amp; loyalty tiers</h3><p>Create and assign customer loyalty tiers to reward repeat buyers.</p></div></div>
<div class="feature is-extra"><div class="feature-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="i"><use href="#i-history"></use></svg></div><div><h3>Order history</h3><p>Store and organise every past order for customers and admins.</p></div></div>
<div class="feature is-extra"><div class="feature-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="i"><use href="#i-heart"></use></svg></div><div><h3>Wishlist</h3><p>Customers save their favourite products and come back to buy.</p></div></div>
<div class="feature is-extra"><div class="feature-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="i"><use href="#i-refresh"></use></svg></div><div><h3>Upgrade your existing app</h3><p>Revamp your current e-commerce app without interrupting your business.</p></div></div>
</div>
<div class="center-actions">
<button aria-controls="feature-grid" aria-expanded="false" class="btn btn-outline-light no-js-hide" id="features-toggle" type="button"><span>Show all 18 features</span><svg aria-hidden="true" class="i"><use href="#i-chevron-down"></use></svg></button>
</div>
</div>
</section>
